    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>Secretions thin and clear; no fever</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No pounding headaches, flushing or sweating above the injury; no leg swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Urine clear; no blockages</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Bowel program effective; no accidents</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Neck and shoulder aching after long days in the chair</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No redness over pressure points</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>6 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

